# J&P Bali Master Scope of Work

Internal Project Documentation

## Project Overview

Develop and enhance the existing WordPress website into a scalable tourism lifestyle platform.

## Existing Infrastructure

Hosting, Domain, WordPress, WooCommerce, Existing Theme, Existing Pages. Enhance existing site; no full rebuild.

## Brand Identity

Tagline: One Tribe. Same Vibe.
Hero: Turn Your Memories Into Premium Wearable Art.
Philosophy: DHB.

## Business Goals

Transform travel memories into premium wearable products with a referral ecosystem.

## Scope of Work

Website Foundation, WooCommerce, Customer Workflow, Partner Platform, Admin Platform.

## Workflow

Customer: QR > Upload > Design > Approval > Payment > Production > Delivery.
Partner: Register > QR > Referrals.
Admin: Order > Review > Production.

## Deliverables

Original Website Agreement + Addendum No.1 deliverables.

## Out of Scope

AI APIs, Mobile App, ERP, CRM, Accounting, Phase 2 & 3.

## Roadmap

Phase 1 Platform Expansion, Phase 2 AI, Phase 3 International Expansion.